flowchart LR
    A[Validated model in registry] --> B[Package: container + deps]
    B --> C[Choose pattern]
    C -- Real-time --> D[REST/gRPC endpoint + autoscale]
    C -- Batch --> E[Scheduled scoring job]
    C -- Streaming --> F[Event consumer]
    C -- Edge --> G[On-device runtime]
    D --> H[Canary / shadow traffic]
    H --> I{Metrics healthy?}
    I -- No --> J[Rollback to previous version]
    I -- Yes --> K[Ramp to 100 percent]
    K --> L[Monitor + alert + retrain loop]
